1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,746
Hello.

2
00:00:01,746 --> 00:00:05,040
Um my family and I are staying here in Trebirch for a week

3
00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:09,000
or two and we wanted to know about the train services.

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,880
We're hoping to do a few local trips.

5
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:12,193
OK.

6
00:00:12,193 --> 00:00:16,575
Well, I can give you lots of details about all the trains going from

7
00:00:16,575 --> 00:00:18,140
Trebirch in the South West.

8
00:00:18,140 --> 00:00:22,996
This leaflet will be very helpful but I can tell you some of the

9
00:00:22,996 --> 00:00:23,690
main things.

10
00:00:23,690 --> 00:00:26,970
We've got two main train stations in the town.

11
00:00:26,970 --> 00:00:31,600
King Street is for local commuter lines and regional services.

12
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:33,267
What about trains to London?

13
00:00:33,267 --> 00:00:36,600
I'll need to go there on business for one day.

14
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:41,880
Then you need to go to Central Station-that's for all the national services.

15
00:00:41,880 --> 00:00:43,940
There are regular trains to London.

16
00:00:43,940 --> 00:00:49,460
They leave Trebirch every half hour on weekdays and every hour at weekends.

17
00:00:49,460 --> 00:00:53,300
It takes about two hours, a bit longer on Sundays.

18
00:00:53,300 --> 00:00:58,044
You've got a choice of first and second class and there's a buffet car

19
00:00:58,044 --> 00:01:02,110
- though refreshments are included in the cost of a first class ticket.

20
00:01:02,110 --> 00:01:02,992
Ah right.

21
00:01:02,992 --> 00:01:03,432
Urn,

22
00:01:03,432 --> 00:01:07,840
and have you got any information on different ticket types?

23
00:01:07,840 --> 00:01:08,221
Yes.

24
00:01:08,221 --> 00:01:12,407
There's a range of ticket prices depending on when you travel

25
00:01:12,407 --> 00:01:14,690
and when you buy your ticket.

26
00:01:14,690 --> 00:01:20,500
There's a standard open ticket which doesn't have any restrictions.

27
00:01:20,500 --> 00:01:23,650
This can be bought in advance or on the day.

28
00:01:23,650 --> 00:01:27,440
You can also get various discounted tickets.

29
00:01:27,440 --> 00:01:33,427
A popular one is called the Supersave and, er, this is OK for travel

30
00:01:33,427 --> 00:01:34,710
after 8.45.

31
00:01:34,710 --> 00:01:37,461
Then there is the Special ticket,

32
00:01:37,461 --> 00:01:41,130
which is valid for travel after 10.15.

33
00:01:41,130 --> 00:01:45,800
The Special tickets are also valid for travel at weekends.

34
00:01:45,800 --> 00:01:51,565
The cheapest tickets are called Advance and you have to buy them at least

35
00:01:51,565 --> 00:01:52,800
six days ahead.

36
00:01:52,800 --> 00:01:58,251
Only a certain number are available and you have to make seat reservations for

37
00:01:58,251 --> 00:01:58,640
these.

38
00:01:58,640 --> 00:01:59,070
Thanks.

39
00:01:59,070 --> 00:02:03,800
And are there lots of places to go to around here?

40
00:02:03,800 --> 00:02:04,800
Oh yes.

41
00:02:04,800 --> 00:02:07,800
You can enjoy many days out.

42
00:02:07,800 --> 00:02:10,481
Um there's the Merthyr Mining Museum,

43
00:02:10,481 --> 00:02:14,950
which is only half an hour from Trebirch by train.

44
00:02:14,950 --> 00:02:19,312
Your children will find it just as fascinating as any theme park

45
00:02:19,312 --> 00:02:24,400
and they can ride in the original miners' lifts and on the coal trains.

46
00:02:24,400 --> 00:02:29,090
There are special excursion tickets which include entrance fees.

47
00:02:29,090 --> 00:02:33,922
Mainline trains also offer direct services to Bristol, where you can visit the docks

48
00:02:33,922 --> 00:02:38,063
or spend a great day out with the children in the zoo,

49
00:02:38,063 --> 00:02:42,550
which is set in the parkland that used to surround the old castle.

50
00:02:42,550 --> 00:02:47,870
Er, special family awayday fares are available for this service now during the school

51
00:02:47,870 --> 00:02:48,250
holidays.

52
00:02:48,250 --> 00:02:52,739
Er, alternatively, you can be in Birmingham in only an hour

53
00:02:52,739 --> 00:02:58,043
and a half, where there's lots to see and do including the new

54
00:02:58,043 --> 00:03:02,940
and internationally-acclaimed climbing wall built on the site of the old aquarium.

55
00:03:02,940 --> 00:03:08,033
We will also be running a special service to Newport when the new science

56
00:03:08,033 --> 00:03:13,126
museum opens next year, as we anticipate a lot of visitors in the opening

57
00:03:13,126 --> 00:03:13,490
weeks.

58
00:03:13,490 --> 00:03:16,898
I'd advise you to call early to book your tickets.

59
00:03:16,898 --> 00:03:17,920
Is that OK?

60
00:03:17,920 --> 00:03:18,310
Yes, thanks.
